ANNOUNCEMENT CG-03 — On advance, the CG will fade out. Background B and both characters must survive underneath. #line:053298d

<<vn_cg_fade_out 1>>
CHECKPOINT CG-04 — The CG must be gone. Background B and both characters must still be visible with their current M3 speaker-focus tint. #line:0e2ce29

ANNOUNCEMENT REGRESSION-01 — On advance, the established M3 immediate expression command will run. It must change immediately, without waiting for a fade. #line:0b3fb45

<<vn_expression m3_a smile>>
CHECKPOINT REGRESSION-02 — Character A must show the smile Head immediately; Body, slot, and M3 speaker-focus behavior must remain intact. #line:0bc611e

